    "title": "This smell startup says its AI nose is as good as a human\u2019s",
    "description": "In a lab near Newark Airport in New Jersey, a team of around 30 experienced human sniffers are slowly working their way through every odor on Earth. Their careful notes\u2014\u201cnutty,\u201d \u201cpeachy,\u201d \u201cmarine\u201d\u2014are cross-referenced with a chemical analysis to create a rich set of training data for what AI startup Osmo calls the world\u2019s first foundation&#8230;",
