    "title": "SID AI Releases SID-2 Agentic Search Model With 0.720 NDCG Swarm Mode",
    "description": "<p>SID AI released SID-2, an agentic search model trained with reinforcement learning. A single agent reaches 0.585 NDCG in 3.11 seconds, and a 12-agent SID-2 Swarm scores 0.720 NDCG, above GPT-6 Astra on SID\u2019s benchmark.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.marktechpost.com/2026/11/17/sid-ai-sid-2-agentic-search-swarm/\">SID AI Releases SID-2 Agentic Search Model With 0.720 NDCG Swarm Mode</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.marktechpost.com\">MarkTechPost</a>.</p>\n",
