    "description": "<p>Anthropic has added Code Mode to Claude Code v2.1.323. The experimental feature lets Claude write JavaScript that chains Bash, Read and Edit calls in 1 step, and keep talking while long commands run.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.marktechpost.com/2026/11/17/anthropic-claude-code-code-mode-javascript-tool-calls/\">Anthropic Adds Code Mode to Claude Code: Claude Now Chains Tool Calls in JavaScript</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.marktechpost.com\">MarkTechPost</a>.</p>\n",
