    "title": "Perplexity Computer Adds Multiagent: Up to 16 AI Agents That Cross-Check Work",
    "description": "<p>Perplexity added Multiagent to Computer, an effort level above Ultra where a lead agent runs up to 16 agents on Claude, GPT and Gemini models that share findings and check each other\u2019s work.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.marktechpost.com/2026/11/17/perplexity-computer-multiagent-effort-level/\">Perplexity Computer Adds Multiagent: Up to 16 AI Agents That Cross-Check Work</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.marktechpost.com\">MarkTechPost</a>.</p>\n",
