    "description": "<p>OpenAI released GPT-6.2 Astra and GPT-6.2 Sol on November 17, 2026. Astra's API price drops 20% to $8/$40 per million tokens, and it ranks second on the Artificial Analysis Intelligence Index.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.marktechpost.com/2026/11/17/openai-gpt-6-2-astra-sol-release/\">OpenAI Releases GPT-6.2 Astra and Sol With a 20% Cheaper Astra API</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.marktechpost.com\">MarkTechPost</a>.</p>\n",
